			"text": "Bandwidth (Network)\n\nHow much data moves in/out?\n\nCovers:\nUpload traffic\nDownload traffic\nStreaming\nReplication traffic\n\nUsed for:\nCDN\nNetwork costs\nNIC sizing\nInter-region traffic",
